        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Legend of the Boneknapper Dragon\n- Companies: DreamWorks Animation\n- Franchises: How to Train Your Dragon\n- People: Cressida Cowell\n- Works: That Rabbit Belongs to Emily Brown\n\nFacts:\n- Legend of the Boneknapper Dragon is a 2010 animated short film.\n- DreamWorks Animation produced Legend of the Boneknapper Dragon.\n- Legend of the Boneknapper Dragon is part of the How to Train Your Dragon franchise.\n- The How to Train Your Dragon franchise is based on books written by Cressida Cowell.\n- Cressida Cowell also wrote That Rabbit Belongs to Emily Brown.",
